OL,4,CNvidia shares slide as Trump's role in 
OL,5,CJensen Huang's comeback questioned by  
OL,6,CUS politicians                         
OL,7,GShares in Nvidia dipped on Tuesday as  
OL,8,GUS politicans questioned President     
OL,9,GDonald Trump's role in the return of   
OL,10,GJensen Huang as chief executive.       
OL,12,FHuang was handed back his job at the   
OL,13,FAI microchip maker on Monday less than 
OL,14,Ftwo weeks after he was forced to       
OL,15,Fresign following the revelations of    
OL,16,Fextra marital affairs, one of which    
OL,17,Fwas with a suspected Chinese spy.      
OL,19,FTrump has said he played a big role in 
OL,20,Fthe 63-year-old's reinstatment, which  
OL,21,Fhas led to questions and backlash from 
OL,22,FUS lawmakers.                          
